# GRUB SHIFT: rolling into a grub pushes it one tile; pushed into a pit, it's
# gone, and even an armoured shellbug can't shrug that off.
game grubshift
wait 5
cheat contract 1 7
cheat clear
cheat bug 3 2 5 1
cheat hole 4 2
cheat use 0 3 2
expect kills == 1
expect px == 3
cheat bug 3 1 3 0
cheat use 1 3 1
expect bug_at31 == 0
expect bug_at30 == 3
expect py == 1
